      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STILTON TARA (5) has not raced since scoring (19.93) over 340m at this track ten weeks ago. Has a good overall strike-rate and looks a key player. STRIKE SWIFTLY (2) ran a nice race on debut when hitting the frame, finishing second (19.67) at this track over 340m. Expecting significant improvement this line-up. ADDERLEY (1) shows ability but remains a maiden after seven starts. Is better than last start when out of the placings, finishing seventh (27.00) at this track. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Should be thereabouts. MIDNIGHT MOOSE (4) is by Vamoose out of Rising Artist making debut. No favours with the draw and will need to begin well. Profiles nicely and can feature in the finish.",
